TITLE Transport H2(g) IAP question

SOLUTION 0-10
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

SOLUTION 11
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

EXCHANGE 0-10
    X- 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -time_step 1
    -lengths 1
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -initial_time 0
    -print_cells 3
    -print_frequency 1
    -punch_cells 3
    -punch_frequency 1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file trans.sel
    -reset false
    -step true
    -si H2(g)

END
